[INPUT START]
Marco introduced himself as an amputee who uses prosthetic limbs. He noted that assistive technologies have transformed the lives of individuals with disabilities. Later, Marco and Marco's colleague discussed smart prosthetics.
[INPUT END]
[OUTPUT START]
{
  "detected_characteristics": [
    {
      "characteristic": "Disability",
      "attribute_value": "Amputee",
      "evidence_spans": [
        {"text": "Marco"}, {"text": "an amputee"}, {"text": "prosthetic limbs"},
        {"text": "Marco"}, {"text": "Marco"}, {"text": "smart prosthetics"}
      ],
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "characteristic": "Disability",
      "attribute_value": "People with disabilities (generic reference)",
      "evidence_spans": [{"text": "individuals with disabilities"}],
      "confidence": 0.90
    }
  ]
}
[OUTPUT END]

